  "raw_text": "PLAN \"Hotel Room Maintenance Block\"\nTYPE workout\nVISIBILITY public\n\nGOALS\n  GOAL primary strength:\n    name \"Maintain muscle mass during travel\"\n\nPHASES\n  PHASE \"Week 1\" (1 weeks):\n    WEEK 1:\n      DAY Monday training 35m \"Upper Body Maintenance\":\n        warmup:\n          jumping_jack 2m\n        main straight_sets:\n          pull_up 3x6..8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          push_up 3x10..15 rpe 7 rest 60 seconds\n          inverted_row 3x8..10 rpe 7 rest 75 seconds\n          dip 3x6..10 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          plank 3x45..60 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          chest_stretch 90s\n          shoulder_stretch 90s\n      DAY Wednesday training 35m \"Lower Body Maintenance\":\n        warmup:\n          jumping_jack 2m\n        main straight_sets:\n          squat 3x10..15 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          split_squat 3x8..12 rpe 7 rest 75 seconds\n          glute_bridge 3x12..15 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          dead_bug 3x10 rpe 5 rest 45 seconds\n          calf_raise 3x15..20 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          quad_stretch 90s\n          hip_flexor_stretch 90s\n      DAY Friday training 35m \"Full Body Maintenance\":\n        warmup:\n          jumping_jack 2m\n        main straight_sets:\n          pull_up 3x5..7 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          push_up 3x12..15 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          split_squat 3x10..12 rpe 7 rest 75 seconds\n          inverted_row 3x8..10 rpe 7 rest 75 seconds\n          hollow_hold 3x20..30 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          back_stretch 90s\n          hip_flexor_stretch 90s\n  PHASE \"Week 2\" (1 weeks):\n    WEEK 2:\n      DAY Monday training 35m \"Upper Body Maintenance\":\n        warmup:\n          jumping_jack 2m\n        main straight_sets:\n          pull_up 3x6..8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          push_up 3x10..15 rpe 7 rest 60 seconds\n          inverted_row 3x8..10 rpe 7 rest 75 seconds\n          dip 3x6..10 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          plank 3x45..60 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          chest_stretch 90s\n          shoulder_stretch 90s\n      DAY Wednesday training 35m \"Lower Body Maintenance\":\n        warmup:\n          jumping_jack 2m\n        main straight_sets:\n          squat 3x10..15 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          split_squat 3x8..12 rpe 7 rest 75 seconds\n          glute_bridge 3x12..15 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          dead_bug 3x10 rpe 5 rest 45 seconds\n          calf_raise 3x15..20 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          quad_stretch 90s\n          hip_flexor_stretch 90s\n      DAY Friday training 35m \"Full Body Maintenance\":\n        warmup:\n          jumping_jack 2m\n        main straight_sets:\n          pull_up 3x5..7 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          push_up 3x12..15 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          split_squat 3x10..12 rpe 7 rest 75 seconds\n          inverted_row 3x8..10 rpe 7 rest 75 seconds\n          hollow_hold 3x20..30 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          back_stretch 90s\n          hip_flexor_stretch 90s",
